  passiveDescription: "\u0110\xF2n \u0111\xE1nh b\u1EAFn c\xF9ng l\xFAc 2 vi\xEAn
    \u0111\u1EA1n. 1 vi\xEAn g\xE2y (#[0]<sprite name=pdmg> + #[1]<sprite name=mdmg>)
    s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EADt l\xFD, vi\xEAn c\xF2n l\u1EA1i g\xE2y (#[2]<sprite
    name=pdmg> + #[3]<sprite name=mdmg>) s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE9p."
  activeDescription: "B\u1EAFn l\u1EA7n l\u01B0\u1EE3t 2 vi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA1n (c\xF3
    th\u1EC3 ch\xED m\u1EA1ng):\n- Vi\xEAn \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn: g\xE2y <color=grey>(#[4]<sprite
    name=pdmg> + #[5]<sprite name=mdmg>)</color> s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EADt
    l\xFD c\xF9ng <color=grey>(#[6]<sprite name=pdmg> + #[7]<sprite name=mdmg>)</color>
    s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE9p, gi\u1EA3m #[13]<sprite name=arm> v\xE0 <sprite
    name=res> c\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu trong #[14]s.\n- Vi\xEAn th\u1EE9 2: g\xE2y
    <color=grey>(#[8]<sprite name=pdmg> + #[9]<sprite name=mdmg>)</color> s\xE1t
    th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EADt l\xFD c\xF9ng <color=grey>(#[10]<sprite name=pdmg>
    + #[11]<sprite name=mdmg>)</color> s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE9p, r\u1ED3i
    n\u1EA3y sang k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t trong ph\u1EA1m vi #[12]
    \xF4 v\xE0 g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u1EF1."
